## Knowledge Graph Statistics

The final Knowledge Graph is composed of the following main entity types:

- Activity
- Location
- Coordinate
- SkiSlope
- HikingTrail
- CycleRoute
- ClimbingRoute
- Hotel
- Restaurant
- SkiRental
- ViewPoint

The Knowledge Graph integrates multiple datasets extracted mainly from OpenStreetMap and public open data sources. Each entity is uniquely identified and enriched with domain-specific attributes.
